## Required Changes

### Change #1: so_that clause
**Before:** So that I do not have to download the document or copy paste large sections of it into a separate REST endpoint just to get a quick gist

**Issue:** "REST endpoint" is an internal implementation term (our API/transport decision). A Claude User does not paste text into a REST endpoint; they experience the benefit of avoiding manual work. The clause should state the user value in user-facing language only.

**After:** So that I can get a quick gist without downloading the document or copy pasting large sections of it into another app

